<figure class="tl__fig">
  <svg class="sv" viewBox="0 0 660 345" role="img" aria-labelledby="pol-t pol-d">
    <title id="pol-t">방향이 정해진 부품 3가지: LED, 다이오드, 전해 커패시터</title>
    <desc id="pol-d">LED는 긴 다리가 플러스, 짧은 다리와 평평한 쪽이 마이너스. 다이오드는 띠가 있는 쪽이 마이너스. 전해 커패시터는 줄무늬 쪽과 짧은 다리가 마이너스.</desc>

    <rect class="panel" x="5" y="5" width="210" height="335" rx="12"/>
    <rect class="panel" x="225" y="5" width="210" height="335" rx="12"/>
    <rect class="panel" x="445" y="5" width="210" height="335" rx="12"/>
    <text class="b l c" x="110" y="36">LED</text>
    <text class="b l c" x="330" y="36">다이오드</text>
    <text class="b l c" x="550" y="36">전해 커패시터</text>

    <!-- LED -->
    <path d="M82 150V110A28 28 0 0 1 138 110V150Z" fill="#e9605a" fill-opacity=".75" stroke="#b8403a" stroke-width="2"/>
    <path d="M76 150H138V160H76Z" fill="#e9605a" fill-opacity=".9" stroke="#b8403a" stroke-width="2"/>
    <line class="lead" x1="96" y1="160" x2="96" y2="250"/>
    <line class="lead" x1="124" y1="160" x2="124" y2="218"/>
    <text class="b l c" x="96" y="276">+</text>
    <text class="s c" x="96" y="296">긴 다리</text>
    <text class="b l" x="134" y="232">−</text>
    <text class="s" x="134" y="252">짧은 다리</text>
    <text class="s" x="134" y="270">평평한 쪽</text>
    <text class="s c" x="110" y="68">테두리가 깎인 쪽이 −</text>

    <!-- 다이오드 -->
    <line class="lead" x1="245" y1="150" x2="290" y2="150"/>
    <line class="lead" x1="370" y1="150" x2="415" y2="150"/>
    <rect x="290" y="130" width="80" height="40" rx="4" fill="#33363c"/>
    <rect x="352" y="130" width="12" height="40" fill="#d9dce1"/>
    <text class="b l c" x="262" y="112">+</text>
    <text class="s c" x="262" y="130">애노드</text>
    <text class="b l c" x="398" y="112">−</text>
    <text class="s c" x="398" y="130">캐소드</text>
    <path d="M358 178V198" stroke="var(--ink2)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
    <text class="s c" x="340" y="216">띠가 있는 쪽이 −</text>
    <text class="s" x="233" y="262">기호</text>
    <path class="wire" d="M262 280H295M295 262V298L325 280ZM325 262V298M325 280H358"/>
    <text class="s c" x="330" y="326">전류는 + 쪽에서 − 쪽으로만 흐름</text>

    <!-- 전해 커패시터 -->
    <path d="M515 205V122Q515 108 529 108H571Q585 108 585 122V205Z" fill="#3b4a63"/>
    <path d="M515 205V122Q515 108 529 108H533V205Z" fill="#c9cfdb"/>
    <text class="b c" x="524" y="140" style="fill:#33363c">−</text>
    <text class="b c" x="524" y="165" style="fill:#33363c">−</text>
    <text class="b c" x="524" y="190" style="fill:#33363c">−</text>
    <line class="lead" x1="530" y1="205" x2="530" y2="250"/>
    <line class="lead" x1="570" y1="205" x2="570" y2="278"/>
    <text class="s c" x="550" y="88">줄무늬 쪽이 −</text>
    <text class="b l" x="465" y="238">−</text>
    <text class="s" x="465" y="256">짧은 다리</text>
    <text class="b l" x="582" y="268">+</text>
    <text class="s" x="582" y="288">긴 다리</text>
    <text class="s" x="455" y="322">기호</text>
    <path class="wire" d="M495 312H536M536 296Q526 312 536 328M552 296V328M552 312H600"/>
    <text class="b" x="560" y="293">+</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>그림 2. 방향(극성)이 있는 부품. 다리 길이는 새 부품일 때만 맞으므로, 줄무늬·띠·평평한 면 같은 표시를 함께 확인합니다.</figcaption>
</figure>
